This project can provision the rhwp 0.8.2 command-line application as a local
runtime backend for binary HWP page-text recovery. rhwp is maintained by the
rhwp contributors and is licensed under the MIT License.

Project homepage: https://github.com/edwardkim/rhwp

rhwp is not vendored into this plugin. The provisioning script downloads an
official release archive, verifies its pinned SHA-256, and installs the binary
and its accompanying license into the Corpus user cache.
